MISSION
Act as a Senior Product Architect, Business Analyst, UX Architect and Technical Systems Analyst.
Your mission is to produce the COMPLETE FUNCTIONAL SPECIFICATION AND STRUCTURAL ARCHITECTURE of the LUMARÉEL platform.
This document must become the single source of truth for the entire product.
The objective is to document every module, every feature, every page, every interaction, every user journey, every operational process, every relationship between modules, and every system dependency.
We must ensure that absolutely no functionality, page, workflow or important state is forgotten.
IMPORTANT: This is a documentation and analysis mission first. Do not modify the code, database, routes or existing interfaces during this first phase.
1. PROJECT CONTEXT AND VISION
LUMARÉEL is a premium entertainment, event production, ticketing, experiences, memories and membership platform.
It is designed to connect event discovery, ticket purchases, customer experiences, digital memories, loyalty, exclusive privileges and event operations inside one interconnected ecosystem.
LUMARÉEL is not simply an online ticketing website.
It is a complete digital ecosystem with four major dimensions:
Public discovery and entertainment.
Customer account and personal experiences.
Community, loyalty and exclusive membership.
Administration, event production and operational management.
The platform must offer a premium, cinematic, modern and seamless experience across desktop, tablet and mobile.
